<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 184 0 R
/E (With over 25 million golfers in the US, many over age 50, grip strength issues are common, especially among those with arthritis. Current solutions like athletic tape, oversized grips, and personal training are often costly, temporary, or inaccessible.)
/Pg 21 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
